flowchart TB
    Q{"What do you need?"}
    Q -->|"store a user's password<br/>(only check it later)"| H["salted slow hash<br/>Argon2id / scrypt / bcrypt / PBKDF2"]
    Q -->|"store an API key the script<br/>must SEND later"| V["vault / secrets manager<br/>or env var → encrypted at rest"]
    Q -->|"prove a file wasn't changed"| S["SHA-256 checksum<br/>(anyone can compute)"]
    Q -->|"prove WHO sent a message"| M["HMAC (shared secret)<br/>or digital signature (private key)"]
    Q -->|"move data over a network"| T["TLS / SSH (in transit)"]
    Q -->|"fit binary into text/JSON/header"| E["base64 = encoding only<br/>NOT security"]
